            Hey guys!
This is my first tab, so please feel free to make a correction. I noticed that there
wasn't any tabs up for this song so I decided to give it a go, and I was surprised how easy
it is to play this song!
Just so you know, this needs to be played on an electric for the right sound. I guess
you could try on an acoustic but I think the strings won't meld together in the sound
properly. I don't know. Try to change it so you only play one string at a time if you
want :)
Also, I didn't include the slidy thing (great English, but I have no idea what its
called) during the Choruses because there wasn't enough time to get to the next note,
but I
added on at the end so you can play it if you want to. I think it added a nice finish to
the song, but you choose. After all, it's you who's playing the song :)
Okay, here goes.

